#### odd inputs
unterminated import string: importModule prefix=[li] replace=[li] type=[ex.com/]
unterminated string elsewhere: suppressed
unterminated block comment: suppressed
crlf line endings: statement prefix=[cou] replace=[cou]
nested calls: expression prefix=[] replace=[]
index brackets: expression prefix=[] replace=[]
after a multi-byte string: statement prefix=[cou] replace=[cou]
an unknown byte before the cursor: expression prefix=[cou] replace=[cou]
a method that is never closed: statement prefix=[cou] replace=[cou]
an empty file: topLevel prefix=[] replace=[]
only a prefix: topLevel prefix=[pa] replace=[pa]
inside a prefix: statement prefix=[co] replace=[count]
right before an identifier: statement prefix=[] replace=[]
a keyword is a prefix too: statement prefix=[ret] replace=[ret]
a float literal before the dot: member prefix=[] replace=[] receiver=1 steps
two dots: suppressed
#### the result cap
default cap: true (more than 100 items), incomplete=false
cap 10: 10 items, incomplete=true
the first ones: count f args break chr continue env exit fileExists ord
cap equals the count: true (same count), incomplete=false
cap 0 is no cap: true (same count)
#### trigger characters and replace spans
name replaces [name]
another trigger character gives the same list: true
